Three kilometers. Respectable. You return slightly less tense.
do GameState.roll_chance(70)
if {check_result}:
	You feel genuinely calm. Whatever the day throws at you, you're ready.
	if {stats.patience} < 10:
		set {stats.patience} += 1
else:
	Legs tired. Patience approximately the same. Probably worth it.
jump morning_menu/activity_choice
